   $q$What is the author's main purpose in this passage?$q$, $q$[{"text":"To persuade readers to give up printed books and use only tablets.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"wrong-purpose-type"},{"text":"To persuade schools to ban screens from every reading classroom.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"wrong-purpose-type"},{"text":"To entertain readers with a story about a student's favorite book.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"wrong-purpose-type"},{"text":"To inform readers about the strengths of both screens and paper.","is_correct":true}]$q$::jsonb, $q$To inform readers about the strengths of both screens and paper.$q$, $q$The passage says "each choice has strengths" and gives a paragraph to each, so it informs. It does not push readers toward only one format.$q$, 'draft', 'b88db7c0-80f6-59a6-b769-ab4b78cfad92')
